; Step 5.11 regression fixture: encryption wrapper compatible with
; the bare carrier `bstr`.
;
; The LHS narrows the carrier with `.x-enc`; the RHS is the bare
; carrier type.  Because the encryption wrapper is a narrowing
; operator, the narrowed LHS is within the bare carrier.

ok = (bstr .x-enc payload) .within bstr

payload = { 1 => int }
